cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the archived release."
title: "scTWAS in colorectal cancer: analysis code, curated peak sets and trained GReX models"
abstract: >-
  Code for cell-type-specific models of genetically regulated expression in normal
  colorectal mucosa and colorectal polyps, their integration with colorectal cancer GWAS
  meta-analyses, and the regulatory, spatial, proteomic, druggability and functional-screen
  analyses reported in the accompanying article.
type: software
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-02"
version: "1.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/XingyiGuo/scTWAS_in_CRC"
keywords:
  - transcriptome-wide association study
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - colorectal cancer
  - genetically regulated expression
  - single-cell ATAC sequencing
